{"id":"n7fm492f4dmgrg4dym33tri18","title":"柳小波变换及其逆变换","originalTitle":null,"summary":"本文研究了一种以高斯函数为分析核、负二阶导数为重构核的柳小波变换，证明了该变换在平方可积函数空间中实现严格重构，并讨论了逆变换核的可设计性。该构造说明非容许高斯分析核可以与合适的局部化对偶核共同实现精确重构，为局部化信号处理提供了数学实例。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=634454&do=blog&id=1561129"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T04:43:16.947Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T04:43:16.947Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表"],"score":38,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}